  <item>
    <title>#20 复盘：内在动力和变得具体</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e48039da891a9cd9c86c31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e48039da891a9cd9c86c31</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 13:50:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个「大厂奋斗逼」阶段性复盘，聊到了以下内容：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 述职的意义：真诚地面对自己，创造成长的正反馈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 接受了自己的优劣势都来自于强内在动力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 具体的力量、in the zone</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> 彼得原理推演版：团队永远无法处在最满意的状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 通过关注噪音找到新的信号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 试着先开枪再瞄准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">23:47</a> 关注人设、掌握自主权</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 把自己当作这里的人，兼容更多不一样的人</span></p>]]></description>
